The built viewer bundles `@cesium/engine` and `@cesium/widgets`, and it carries the
Cesium runtime asset tree — `Assets`, `Workers` and `ThirdParty` — as files. That
whole tree ships inside the `viewer` release artifact.

`build.mjs` copies the two upstream license files into the built tree, as
`dist/cesium/LICENSE-engine.md` and `dist/cesium/LICENSE-widgets.md`, so the license
text travels with the files it covers.

